roup + TargetGroupBinding (target-type=ip)&#10;Secret app-config              →   /etc/petclinic/data-access.properties 파일 마운트 (readOnly 0440)&#10;ServiceAccount petclinic-app + IRSA role-arn   →   Pod 안에 AWS 자격증명 주입 (노드 권한이 아님)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2158" width="1358" height="148" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="범례&#10;──  실선 : 실제 동작 경로 (번호 1→5 = 브라우저 → AWS WAF → internet-facing ALB → Pod web → Pod app → RDS)&#10;- - 점선 : 지원 경로 (DNS / TLS / egress / image pull / secret mount / logs / kubelet 상태 보고)&#10;Pod IP = 노드 ENI 의 보조 IP (VPC CNI) → ALB 가 Pod 를 직접 target 으로 등록한다. ClusterIP 는 VPC 대역 밖의 가상 IP (iptables).&#10;Isolated data 서브넷 : NAT/IGW 경로 없음 (VPC local 만) · RDS Multi-AZ (2b primary / 2a standby)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2336" width="1358" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ed1" value="HTTPS 443" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=light-dark(#1B2733,#CFE0F0);strokeColor=light-dark(#1A1A1A,#E0E0E0);strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#0B0F14);exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="internet" target="waf"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="731" y="468"/><mxPoint x="731" y="452"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed1_b" value="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#3F7D20;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ed1"><mxGeometry x="-0.6" y="0" width="24" height="24" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-12" y="-12" 